%% title: Party Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING_KYC: POST /parties (party created)

  PENDING_KYC --> PENDING_KYC: KYC/AML outcome not yet terminal
  PENDING_KYC --> ACTIVE: kyc=APPROVED AND aml=CLEARED (two-key gate)
  PENDING_KYC --> SUSPENDED: kyc=REJECTED OR aml=BLOCKED

  ACTIVE --> SUSPENDED: kyc=REJECTED OR aml=BLOCKED (re-screen event)
  ACTIVE --> CLOSED: DELETE /parties/{id} (GDPR Art. 17 erasure)

  SUSPENDED --> ACTIVE: kyc=APPROVED AND aml=CLEARED (re-clearance)
  SUSPENDED --> CLOSED: manual closure / GDPR erasure

  CLOSED --> [*]: terminal — never re-opened

  note right of PENDING_KYC
    kycStatus: NOT_STARTED → IN_PROGRESS → APPROVED/REJECTED/EXPIRED
    amlStatus: NOT_SCREENED → CLEARED/BLOCKED
  end note

  note right of ACTIVE
    Both keys cleared.
    Account opening permitted.
  end note

  note right of SUSPENDED
    Hard negative on either key.
    Fail-closed — no account ops.
  end note
